      "chunk_text": "Customer Ishaan Bose calls insurance agent Sunita Agarwal to discuss renewing his Health Plus plan and upgrading to the Comprehensive Care Plan. Sunita breaks down the pricing ($425/month, reduced to $403.75 with the 5% early-renewal discount) and confirms the $10 processing fee. Ishaan successfully processes the payment for the renewed policy starting 01/10/2026. He also inquires about document requirements (signed renewal form and utility bill) and subsequently requests the addition of the Global Traveller Rider for international coverage ($25/month), for which Sunita agrees to send details and a separate payment link.",
